public interface DimFilter extends Cacheable
{
  // ...
}
```

This means a JSON payload with `"type": "javascript"` will deserialize to `JavaScriptDimFilter`.

#### 2. JavaScriptFilter (Segment Filter Implementation)
**File:** `/root/druid/processing/src/main/java/org/apache/druid/segment/filter/JavaScriptFilter.java`

This is the actual runtime Filter implementation created from `JavaScriptDimFilter.toFilter()`. It doesn't have @JacksonInject but is created by the DimFilter.

